 release the curse placed upon the world of Mistralis by the evil spirit Balasar. \n\r\n\n\r\nThe game’s novel and playful control mechanism lets you use Enril’s elemental powers to help Toku in your quest to overcome Balasar – powering his jumps and glides through Mistralis’ different regions, buffeting and smashing enemies, and solving puzzles.\n\r\n\n\r\nExperience all of the magic of Mistralis, a land full of wonder and intrigue that bursts to life with your every action and exploration.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/header.jpg?t=1725376950"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1725376950"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_04efb20c465463d957d5016274d5517b852a85fb.600x338.jpg?t=1725376950","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_04efb20c465463d957d5016274d5517b852a85fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1725376950"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_b5e6502e1043e2dfe4b6a4b59e19ec4dc19f26f1.600x338.jpg?t=1725376950","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_b5e6502e1043e2dfe4b6a4b59e19ec4dc19f26f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1725376950"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_961accd5e2092781c302f03a38d00bb69cc4f23a.600x338.jpg?t=1725376950","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_961accd5e2092781c302f03a38d00bb69cc4f23a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1725376950"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/447780/ss_1d